{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2021-03-22 17:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'AUSTIN, MINN., MARCH 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK, AUTHORIZED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT 24.50 CENTS ($0.2450) A SHARE ON MARCH 22, 2021, WILL BE PAID MAY 17, 2021, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 12, 2021.'}